ConstitutionBoss.Hint: Hold a [i:DestroyerTest/BladeChunk] Blade Chunk up to the sky. Its resonant energy will signal for others to arrive.
WyvernCorpse.Hint: Not much remains of the Great Wyvern, but if you can repurpose the small amounts of its soul inside the [i:DestroyerTest/Item_BlessingAltar] Blessing Altar, you may be able to draw it to you.
NightmareRose.Hint:
	'''
	Obtain a Collection of stories no person should ever be reading, and unfurl its pages in the corruption. 
	The Rose requires all solid tiles in a sizable area to be removed and for the land below the cleared area to be flat and filled in.
	In Eternity Mode / Death Mode, this requirement is ignored.
	'''
CursedFlameNodeMB.Hint: Spawns naturally in the corruption after Plantera is defeated.
IchorNodeMB.Hint: Spawns naturally in the crimson after Plantera is defeated.
BlessedNodeMB.Hint: Spawns naturally in the hallow after Plantera is defeated.
TenebrousConstruct.Hint: This boss and it's related content is under construction and is reserved for a later update. Thus, you will have to cheat in the spawn item.
